<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<style>{css}</style></head><body><main>
<h1>{glyph}serverjack{title_small}</h1>
<div class="flash">Session “{name}” has ended.</div>
<p class="note">It exited, or was killed or renamed somewhere else; nothing is running under that
name any more. The session list is in the window this one was opened from.</p>
<div class="btns"><button class="btn sec" id="close" type="button">Close</button></div>
